      "evidence_notes": [
        "The exact 17 public records are selected by the authors' tagged predicate and content-addressed membership fixture.",
        "Live-seq cytoplasmic biopsy precedes LPS by 0.5 to 1.5 hours and preserves the cell for direct image tracking.",
        "The same-cell future target is the published mCherry.log.slope derived over 3 to 7.5 hours after LPS."
      ],
      "assumptions": [
        "The partial cytoplasmic transcriptome is an informative, noisy proxy for the cell's pre-LPS molecular state.",
        "Any Live-seq collection effect does not erase the state-to-future association, while residual collection effects remain part of the estimand.",
        "The published bounded collection and reporter windows are comparable across the selected records.",
        "Selection from 40 dual-assay cells to 17 RNA-QC-passing cells is not assumed missing at random.",
        "Interpretation is restricted to this RAW264.7-G9 culture and LPS protocol."
      ],
      "blockers": [
        "The raw per-frame reporter trajectories and exact excluded-cell reason codes are not publicly released.",
        "There is no independent biological replicate or untouched test partition within the 17-cell cohort."
      ]
    },
